; from row 12 (0 or $50). Character $42 = left cap (text_font_keycap_left), $56 = right cap
; (text_font_keycap_right), $40 = inverted blank, $00 = blank; columns 15, 24, 26 and 36. Flag 0 puts the
; box around the first choice.
