; silences the sound, patches the big digit of current_player into player_banner_top/bottom and copies the
; banner to screen rows 7 and 8 (column 12). Then installs irq_player_screen (raster line $63) in irq_vector,
; shows the screen and waits 64 frames (128 in a two-player game) on frame_countdown. The 24-bit busy counter
; player_screen_wait ends the wait if the interrupt stops. Called by start_new_game and by lose_fall.
show_player_screen
